      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti also oxidizes selectively under oxidizing conditions, but less strongly than Cr.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Surface enrichment and oxidation of Cr initially produce a continuous, adherent, passivating Cr-rich scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6164265::web::043::4_4_oxidation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Discontinuous Ti-rich oxide nodules emerge after longer oxidizing exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The external oxide scale partially spalls after prolonged oxidizing exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6164265::web::043::4_4_oxidation"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under reducing conditions, a coherent protective external scale fails to form or becomes unstable.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing conditions produce more internal oxidation than oxidizing conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Internal oxidation is concentrated along grain boundaries and other microstructural inhomogeneities.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
